{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Item DBC supplement rows reach the client through the item patch stream (#6540)",
  "contract": [
    "Requires CoA.SendDisplayPatches=1. The client's own Item.dbc carries no row for seven items this realm",
    "publishes through `item_dbc` because its DBC set lacks them: Red Ribboned Wrapping Paper 5042 (display",
    "6405), Blue Ribboned Wrapping Paper 5048 (6330), Purple Ribboned Wrapping Paper 17307 (29443),",
    "Cuirboulli Boots 2143 (2355), Magatha's Note 10678 (3024), Outrider's Bow 20437 (32079) and",
    "Arcanite Ripper (NEW) 44924 (57733). AscensionCompat streams an SQL item row only while its id is",
    "registered with ClientItemPatches, so an unregistered `item_dbc` row never reaches the client: the",
    "vendor list still draws the bought wrapping paper from the item query's DisplayInfoID, but the bag",
    "looks the entry up in the client's own table and paints a question mark. Storing one of those entries",
    "must send its eight-field SMSG_PATCH_ITEM (0x0932) row, DisplayInfoID at index 5. The registered",
    "Heartwood Key 1041710 is the control and keeps streaming, once per character."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "location": {
    "map": 0,
    "x": -9465,
    "y": 64,
    "z": 56,
    "o": 0
  },
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "shopper",
      "race": 2,
      "class": 27,
      "level": 41
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "action": "client_packet",
      "actor": "shopper",
      "opcode": 1377
    },
    {
      "action": "wait",
      "ms": 100
    },
    {
      "action": "add_item",
      "label": "Buy Red Ribboned Wrapping Paper 5042",
      "actor": "shopper",
      "item": 5042
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "The bought wrapping paper sends exactly one item patch row",
      "actor": "shopper",
      "metric": "server_packets",
      "opcode": 2354,
      "row": 5042,
      "equals": 1,
      "within_ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "That row carries display 6405 at index 5",
      "actor": "shopper",
      "metric": "server_packet_u32",
      "opcode": 2354,
      "row": 5042,
      "index": 5,
      "equals": 6405,
      "within_ms": 1000
    },
    {
      "action": "assert",
      "label": "The row keeps the realm's class 0 and subclass 8",
      "actor": "shopper",
      "metric": "server_packet_u32",
      "opcode": 2354,
      "row": 5042,
      "index": 2,
      "equals": 8
    },
